<div class="container"><div class="item-hero">
  <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/flamethrower-stackburger.webp" alt="FlameThrower® Signature Stackburger — Dairy Queen" loading="eager" width="600" height="450"></div>
  <div>
    <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">Signature Stackburger</span><span class="badge">100% Real Beef</span><span class="badge blue">Bold &amp; Spicy</span></div>
    <h1>FlameThrower® Signature Stackburger</h1>
    <div class="item-price-lg">$10.87</div>
    <p>Dairy Queen's most fiery culinary creation: seasoned 100% pure beef seared hot, layered under melted Pepper Jack cheese, crisp bacon strips, freshly sliced jalapeños, garden-crisp lettuce, and juicy tomato, all drenched in DQ's signature cayenne-spiced FlameThrower sauce. Clocking in at 780 calories and $10.87 for serious spice devotees.</p>

    <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Price</td><td>$10.87 (single) · ~$13.49 (double)</td></tr><tr><td>Calories</td><td>780 cal (single)</td></tr><tr><td>Total Fat</td><td>47g</td></tr><tr><td>Sodium</td><td>1,320mg</td></tr><tr><td>Protein</td><td>42g</td></tr><tr><td>Beef</td><td>100% real seasoned beef, never frozen</td></tr></tbody></table>
    <div style="margin-top:22px;"><a href="/#full-menu" class="btn btn-primary">Full Menu →</a></div>
  </div>
